This repository contains modifications and extensions to Multimodal Open R1:
https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/open-r1-multimodal

Multimodal Open R1 is a fork of Hugging Face Open R1:
https://github.com/huggingface/open-r1

Upstream source files retain their original copyright and Apache-2.0
license headers. New training, allocation, evaluation, and reproducibility
changes are distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.
